{"seq":1,"slug":"ci-cd-data-testing","title":"CI/CD 中的数据测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/pipeline-integration/ci-cd-data-testing","wordCount":1089,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-cd-中的数据测试\">CI/CD 中的数据测试</h1><p>数据管道的代码变更——新增转换逻辑、修改 Schema、调整业务规则——与应用代码变更面临相同的风险：在开发环境看似正确，到生产环境却引发问题。将数据质量测试集成到 CI/CD 流程中，意味着每次代码变更都必须通过质量门控才能到达生产环境。这是从&quot;事后发现问题&quot;到&quot;事前阻止问题&quot;的范式转变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CI/CD 数据测试的三层模型：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>测试金字塔</strong>：单元测试（转换逻辑）→ 集成测试（样本数据上的规则验证）→ 端到端测试（全量数据扫描），越底层越快越频繁</li>\n<li><strong>环境隔离</strong>：CI 用 seed fixtures、Staging 用脱敏副本、Production 用真实数据，各环境目的不同</li>\n<li><strong>质量门控</strong>：将质量检查结果映射为 PR 的可合并状态，失败即阻断部署</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"数据测试在-ci-cd-中的位置\">数据测试在 CI/CD 中的位置</h2><p>传统应用 CI/CD 的测试金字塔（单元→集成→端到端）在数据领域有对应物：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用测试层</th>\n<th>数据测试对应</th>\n<th>执行阶段</th>\n<th>执行时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>转换逻辑单测（dbt unit test）</td>\n<td>PR/MR 提交时</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>数据质量规则在样本数据上执行</td>\n<td>CI 构建时</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端测试</td>\n<td>全量数据上的质量扫描</td>\n<td>部署后/定时</td>\n<td>分钟-小时级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph PR阶段&#10;        A[代码变更] --&gt; B[语法检查]&#10;        B --&gt; C[单元测试]&#10;        C --&gt; D[规则编译验证]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph CI构建&#10;        D --&gt; E[样本数据集成测试]&#10;        E --&gt; F[Schema兼容性检查]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph CD部署&#10;        F --&gt; G[Staging环境全量扫描]&#10;        G --&gt; H{质量门通过?}&#10;        H --&gt;|是| I[部署到生产]&#10;        H --&gt;|否| J[回滚+通知]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph PR阶段\n        A[代码变更] --&gt; B[语法检查]\n        B --&gt; C[单元测试]\n        C --&gt; D[规则编译验证]\n    end\n    subgraph CI构建\n        D --&gt; E[样本数据集成测试]\n        E --&gt; F[Schema兼容性检查]\n    end\n    subgraph CD部署\n        F --&gt; G[Staging环境全量扫描]\n        G --&gt; H{质量门通过?}\n        H --&gt;|是| I[部署到生产]\n        H --&gt;|否| J[回滚+通知]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"github-actions-实现\">GitHub Actions 实现</h2><p>以 dbt + Great Expectations 为例的完整 CI 工作流：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/data-quality.yml&#10;name: Data Quality Gate&#10;on:&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    paths:&#10;      - &#39;models/**&#39;&#10;      - &#39;expectations/**&#39;&#10;      - &#39;contracts/**&#39;&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  syntax-check:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-python@v5&#10;        with:&#10;          python-version: &#39;3.11&#39;&#10;          cache: pip&#10;      - run: pip install dbt-core dbt-postgres great_expectations soda-core&#10;      - name: dbt 编译检查&#10;        run: dbt compile --target ci&#10;      - name: Expectation 语法验证&#10;        run: python scripts/validate_expectations.py&#10;&#10;  integration-test:&#10;    needs: syntax-check&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    services:&#10;      postgres:&#10;        image: postgres:16&#10;        env:&#10;          POSTGRES_DB: test_warehouse&#10;          POSTGRES_PASSWORD: test&#10;        ports:&#10;          - 5432:5432&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - run: pip install dbt-postgres great_expectations&#10;      - name: 加载测试 fixtures&#10;        run: dbt seed --target ci&#10;      - name: 执行转换&#10;        run: dbt run --target ci&#10;      - name: dbt 测试&#10;        run: dbt test --target ci&#10;      - name: GX Checkpoint&#10;        run: great_expectations checkpoint run ci_checkpoint&#10;      - name: 上传质量报告&#10;        if: always()&#10;        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          name: data-quality-report&#10;          path: great_expectations/uncommitted/data_docs/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/data-quality.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Data Quality Gate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'models/**'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'expectations/**'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'contracts/**'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  syntax-check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-python@v5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          python-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3.11'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pip</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pip install dbt-core dbt-postgres great_expectations soda-core</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dbt 编译检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dbt compile --target ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Expectation 语法验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">python scripts/validate_expectations.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  integration-test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    needs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">syntax-check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      postgres</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres:16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          POSTGRES_DB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">test_warehouse</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          POSTGRES_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5432:5432</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pip install dbt-postgres great_expectations</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">加载测试 fixtures</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dbt seed --target ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">执行转换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dbt run --target ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dbt 测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dbt test --target ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GX Checkpoint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">great_expectations checkpoint run ci_checkpoint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">上传质量报告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">always()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/upload-artifact@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">data-quality-report</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">great_expectations/uncommitted/data_docs/</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"环境隔离策略\">环境隔离策略</h2><p>数据 CI 的核心挑战是&quot;测试用什么数据&quot;。不同环境的数据策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环境</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>规则集</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CI（PR）</td>\n<td>Seed/Fixture 小数据集</td>\n<td>全量规则</td>\n<td>验证逻辑正确性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Staging</td>\n<td>生产数据的脱敏副本</td>\n<td>全量规则 + 性能基准</td>\n<td>验证数据兼容性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Production</td>\n<td>真实数据</td>\n<td>全量规则</td>\n<td>持续监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>CI 环境的测试数据管理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 dbt seed 加载确定性测试数据（&lt; 100 行，覆盖边界条件）</li>\n<li>测试数据与代码同源版本控制——数据变更也走 PR 审查</li>\n<li>包含已知缺陷的数据行，验证规则能正确捕获（&quot;测试的测试&quot;）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"schema-变更的兼容性检查\">Schema 变更的兼容性检查</h2><p>Schema 变更是数据管道中断的首要原因。CI 中应该包含 Schema 兼容性验证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def check_schema_compatibility(current_schema: dict, proposed_schema: dict) -&gt; list:&#10;    breaking_changes = []&#10;&#10;    for col in current_schema[&quot;columns&quot;]:&#10;        proposed_col = find_column(proposed_schema, col[&quot;name&quot;])&#10;        if proposed_col is None:&#10;            breaking_changes.append(&#10;                f&quot;BREAKING: Column &#39;{col[&#39;name&#39;]}&#39; removed&quot;&#10;            )&#10;        elif proposed_col[&quot;type&quot;] != col[&quot;type&quot;]:&#10;            if not is_safe_type_widening(col[&quot;type&quot;], proposed_col[&quot;type&quot;]):&#10;                breaking_changes.append(&#10;                    f&quot;BREAKING: Column &#39;{col[&#39;name&#39;]}&#39; type changed &quot;&#10;                    f&quot;from {col[&#39;type&#39;]} to {proposed_col[&#39;type&#39;]}&quot;&#10;                )&#10;    return breaking_changes\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> check_schema_compatibility</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current_schema: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, proposed_schema: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    breaking_changes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> col </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_schema[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"columns\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        proposed_col </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> find_column(proposed_schema, col[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> proposed_col </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            breaking_changes.append(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BREAKING: Column '</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">col[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'name'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' removed\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        elif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> proposed_col[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> col[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_safe_type_widening(col[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], proposed_col[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                breaking_changes.append(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BREAKING: Column '</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">col[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'name'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' type changed \"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"from </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">col[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> to </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">proposed_col[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> breaking_changes</span></span></code></pre></div><p>安全的 Schema 变更（非破坏性）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>新增可空列</li>\n<li>类型拓宽（<code>INT</code> → <code>BIGINT</code>，<code>VARCHAR(50)</code> → <code>VARCHAR(100)</code>）</li>\n<li>新增带默认值的列</li>\n</ul>\n<p>破坏性变更（需要契约协商）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>删除列</li>\n<li>重命名列</li>\n<li>类型缩窄</li>\n<li>将可空列改为非空</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这个检查逻辑与 <a href=\"schema-contract-testing\">Schema 契约测试</a> 中的契约验证框架直接关联。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质量门控的阈值设计\">质量门控的阈值设计</h2><p>不是所有质量检查失败都应该阻断部署。门控阈值需要分层设计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>门控级别</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬性阻断</td>\n<td>Critical 规则失败</td>\n<td>PR 不可合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软性警告</td>\n<td>Warning 规则失败率 &gt; 5%</td>\n<td>PR 标记需要审查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息提示</td>\n<td>Info 级别变化</td>\n<td>注释在 PR 中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>免豁条件</td>\n<td>已知数据源问题</td>\n<td>临时跳过特定规则</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>豁免机制的安全实践</strong>：临时跳过规则时必须关联 issue/ticket，设置过期时间，且需要至少两人审批。避免&quot;临时&quot;豁免变成永久漏洞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试结果的可视化反馈\">测试结果的可视化反馈</h2><p>CI 中质量检查的结果应该直接反馈到 PR 中，让审查者无需打开外部系统即可判断：</p>\n<p><strong>PR Comment Bot</strong>：将质量摘要作为 PR 评论发布：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"📊 Data Quality Report&#10;━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━&#10;✅ 47/50 expectations passed&#10;⚠️  2 warnings (non-blocking)&#10;❌ 1 critical failure (blocking)&#10;&#10;Failed: expect_column_values_to_not_be_null&#10;  Table: orders | Column: customer_id&#10;  Failed records: 3/10000 (0.03%)&#10;&#10;Details: [View Full Report](link-to-artifact)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>📊 Data Quality Report</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ 47/50 expectations passed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>⚠️  2 warnings (non-blocking)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ 1 critical failure (blocking)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Failed: expect_column_values_to_not_be_null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Table: orders | Column: customer_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Failed records: 3/10000 (0.03%)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Details: [View Full Report](link-to-artifact)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>GitHub Status Check</strong>：将质量结果映射为 GitHub commit status，直接影响 PR 的 mergeable 状态。</p>\n<p>这种 CI 集成为后续的 <a href=\"streaming-quality-realtime\">流式数据质量监控</a> 提供了&quot;代码正确&quot;的保障——确保管道逻辑在部署到流式环境之前已经通过了静态验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>将数据质量测试集成到 CI/CD 实现了&quot;问题在生产之前被阻止&quot;的目标。测试金字塔确保了从逻辑正确性到数据兼容性的完整覆盖，环境隔离策略让测试既可靠又可重复，质量门控将检测结果转化为具有约束力的部署决策。与运行时的流式监控和 Schema 契约测试形成互补，共同构成数据管道的完整防护体系。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CI/CD 中的数据测试","id":"ci-cd-中的数据测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"数据测试在 CI/CD 中的位置","id":"数据测试在-ci-cd-中的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"GitHub Actions 实现","id":"github-actions-实现"},{"level":2,"text":"环境隔离策略","id":"环境隔离策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema 变更的兼容性检查","id":"schema-变更的兼容性检查"},{"level":2,"text":"质量门控的阈值设计","id":"质量门控的阈值设计"},{"level":2,"text":"测试结果的可视化反馈","id":"测试结果的可视化反馈"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自定义校验引擎设计与构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/frameworks-tools/custom-validation-engines"},"next":{"title":"流式数据质量实时监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/pipeline-integration/streaming-quality-realtime"}}